### CLI Interface
- Simple turn-by-turn chat interface using readline
- `--list-models` flag to show available models
- `--model <model>` flag to select model (default: gpt-4)
- No AI code included - just the TUI shell
- Ready for user to implement API calls

### Usage
- `npm run dev` - Start interactive chat
- `npm run dev -- --list-models` - List models
- `npm run dev -- --model claude-3-sonnet` - Select model

